  "activityTypeRentDes": "By default every facility will make the option to rent available",
  "activityTypeShortTerm": "Players can challenge the renter (and vice versa) by setting wages or anti's - you get to limit what types of wages are possible and not possible. (i.e - games that generate a large viewing may also offer the winning team free bookings by you the facility owner)",

  "activityTypeInformalGameDes": "Make Informal pick up games available for renters so that a renter can open their slot to new or past players, the renter will be able to set the amount for new players who join their available slots, split costs or make their slots free",
  "activityTypeRunsDes": "Give renters the option to setup runs or host a team based session, giving renters the ability to organize teams, confirm attendance, split costs, or make un-used slots available publicly with the option to generate invite codes/links",
  "activityTypeTournamentDes": "Give renters the option to organize tournament sessions, broken up over the course of multiple bookings, renters can create, facilitate and monetize winner takes all matches based on teams/player slot availabilities managed by the renter, set limits on the type of prizes renters can set (money, clothing, BTC, free bookings, any etc.)",
  "activityTypeOneOnOneDes": "Let renters host one on one matches - renters can split the cost between each other or up the anti (decided by the renter or challenger). Let both players play until one wins. You can limit the types of wages or prizes set by the renter",
  "activityTypeCoachingDes": "Give Coaches who rent from you the option host coaching sessions, depending on the type of coach - you can require specific coaching affiliated types (like making your rentals available for coaches affiliated with schools only) or coaches who only train at a specific skill level etc. (pre-teens, adults etc.). This may make it easier to cater to the additional activities or programs you offer, by narrowing the ranges of groups who are using your space.",
  "activityTypeTrainingDes": "Give Trainers who rent from you the option to host training sessions, you can limit trainers to private trainers only or trainers that deal with large groups",
  "activityTypeTeachingDes": "Give Teachers or Instructors who rent from you the option to host classes, similar to coaches - teachers or instructors can rent out your space based on specific requirements like minimum attendances or restricting rentals to specific affiliates (i.e teachers sourced from organizations only, institutions, freelancers etc.)",

  "activityTypeLongTerm": "Designate months/days/hours - partner with organizations depending on criteria (sponsorships, ad placements, donations, loans, grants, and do they meet all prerequisites?",
  "activityTypeLeaguesDes": "Give renters, the option to setup their own leagues through an organization (private or professional) or recreationally (amongst friends, co-workers or colleagues), you'll be able to designate specific hours and dates for renters looking to create their own - you can set which leagues might qualify for any promotional opportunities - for example offering sponsorships, grants, ad placements etc. depending on what would a partnership look like? - set rewards for leagues       ",
  "activityTypeCampDes": "Designate dates, months or hours for renters looking to host their camp at your facility",

  "activityTypeLongTermBenefits": "Tips: You may also utilize trainers/camps/leagues as a good opportunity to inform new or past sponsors exactly how, when and who will be renting your facility - giving prospective investors, renters & players a clear snapshot of the types of expected use (i.e elite competitive camps vs. pre-school/intermediate juniors)  and frequency (especially useful for informing sponsors how you plan to utilize spaces designated for in person advertisements or brand partnerships)",

